Date: 2024-06-01
Subject: Letter of claim: breach of the Supply Agreement

Trinsic Collagen Ltd alleges that Procoll Ltd is in breach of the Supply Agreement dated 7 November 2022: the collagen supplied in the monthly batches from March to November 2023 had a microbial content which exceeded the agreed specification and/or was not fit for purpose because it suffered reformation. Trinsic claims a refund of £172,000.

